+            2 * MAX_RESOLVE_RESTARTS,
+            "giving up is BOUNDED work: each attempt costs the root read plus the one \
+             re-check that finds the generation retired, and there are exactly \
+             MAX_RESOLVE_RESTARTS of them — the record's churn buys the reader no more"
